WEBVTT

00:02.670 --> 00:04.500
My name is Theodisia,

00:04.500 --> 00:07.460
<b>Swordsman who hid her true nature</b>

00:04.500 --> 00:07.460
<b>and infiltrated the trial.</b>

00:04.830 --> 00:07.500
and I'm searching for
my missing younger sister.

00:07.960 --> 00:12.000
I came here because I heard my people
were trapped here.

00:12.000 --> 00:16.210
So you basically want us
to help find your sister?

00:16.380 --> 00:17.420
Yes.

00:17.420 --> 00:22.170
But your helping me may look like
hostility towards the Swordmaster.

00:22.170 --> 00:26.960
Well, I'm already messing up the tower
like I'm not on his side,

00:26.960 --> 00:29.880
but relying on my ability won't help you.

00:29.880 --> 00:32.420
The best we can do
is search alongside you.

00:32.630 --> 00:35.750
I would be grateful
for even just a little help.

00:35.750 --> 00:38.460
Do you have any clues
as to what to look for?

00:38.460 --> 00:40.460
I think underground may be one.

00:40.460 --> 00:43.330
I can somehow
feel the presence of my people.

00:43.330 --> 00:45.040
Gah, jeez!

00:45.540 --> 00:47.330
We barely made it because

00:47.330 --> 00:47.630
you kept taking your sweet time!

00:47.630 --> 00:49.040
I'm sorry!
you kept taking your sweet time!<b></b>

00:49.040 --> 00:51.000
Now calm down, Frederica-san.

00:51.000 --> 00:52.170
Rick-san!

00:52.750 --> 00:55.710
Dannoura-san!
I'm pleased to see you're safe!

00:55.710 --> 00:59.040
And you made it out too, Lynel-san.

00:59.040 --> 01:01.130
Yes, somehow...

02:32.080 --> 02:35.460
<b>"Standard Opening of Gate Number One Confirmed"</b>

02:34.170 --> 02:35.500
This room...

02:35.500 --> 02:37.580
it's the same hall we arrived in.

02:37.830 --> 02:39.040
Time's up.

02:40.290 --> 02:41.290
Now then...

02:41.580 --> 02:43.880
Seventeen of you have passed, huh?

02:43.880 --> 02:45.040
I now proclaim all of you

02:45.040 --> 02:46.960
Knights of the Divine Ki-

02:45.040 --> 02:48.710
<b>Swordmaster Urabe</b>

02:45.040 --> 02:48.710
<b>Monitors the seal of the Dark God,</b>

02:45.040 --> 02:48.710
<b>and runs the tower trials.</b>

02:46.960 --> 02:48.250
Swordmaster-sama!

02:48.750 --> 02:50.210
We have an emergency!

02:50.210 --> 02:51.460
What's happening?

02:51.460 --> 02:53.040
The tower has fallen silent!

02:53.040 --> 02:55.170
There's difficulty maintaining
the first barrier!

02:55.170 --> 02:57.420
The periphery of the
second barrier is unstable!

02:57.420 --> 03:00.250
Estimated time for spawn of the Dark God
to breach the barrier is fluctuating-

03:01.290 --> 03:02.790
Wh-what?!

03:08.750 --> 03:10.710
The first barrier has dissipated!

03:10.710 --> 03:12.710
The second barrier is barely staying up!

03:15.250 --> 03:19.630
I thought if I blew away the tower,
the barrier would disappear.

03:21.040 --> 03:23.460
What is this overwhelming miasma?

03:23.460 --> 03:26.290
I heard this would happen
three days from now...

03:26.290 --> 03:27.380
Oh, well.

03:27.380 --> 03:30.540
Everyone, this is your first task
as a Knight of the Divine King.

03:30.790 --> 03:34.460
You must defeat that thing,
or humanity is done for.

03:34.460 --> 03:35.330
All right.

03:35.330 --> 03:37.420
Let's go underground and search
while we still have time.

03:37.420 --> 03:39.210
You're not gonna do anything about this?!

03:39.210 --> 03:43.330
If I beat that thing it might
catch the attention of the Swordmaster,

03:43.330 --> 03:46.420
so it's more convenient
to let the other's do it.

03:46.420 --> 03:47.830
I agree.

03:48.170 --> 03:50.330
W-we should get out of here too!

03:50.330 --> 03:52.960
It's too late to escape
opponents like those!

03:52.960 --> 03:55.420
We can't win with cowards around!

03:56.750 --> 03:59.290
How do I get rid of the barrier?

03:59.290 --> 04:01.710
Tell me and I won't kill you.

04:01.710 --> 04:06.420
How very kind of you
after suddenly destroying my tower.

04:10.080 --> 04:12.000
I'll kill all of you one by one,

04:12.000 --> 04:14.290
so when you feel like telling me,
speak up.

04:17.540 --> 04:19.290
You don't know who you're dealing with!

04:24.170 --> 04:26.460
We'd waste you without that barrier!

04:28.750 --> 04:30.210
That's way too big!

04:30.210 --> 04:33.130
Take this! Full power!

04:33.130 --> 04:36.960
Super Compressed Extreme Light Burst!

04:41.420 --> 04:42.500
Huh?!

04:42.500 --> 04:45.670
That was quite formidable for a human.

04:46.630 --> 04:49.830
Maybe if it had hit
I might've been burned or something.

04:50.250 --> 04:52.750
One more unique entity has appeared!

04:52.750 --> 04:54.040
This is bad...

04:54.040 --> 04:56.210
Make sure you call us by our names!

04:56.210 --> 04:59.290
I'm Lute, and this is Orgain.

04:59.290 --> 05:00.500
Glad to meet ya!

05:00.670 --> 05:01.710
You little...!

05:01.710 --> 05:02.710
Hup.

05:05.330 --> 05:09.080
Lady, you aren't at the right level
to face us.

05:09.080 --> 05:10.420
What was that?!

05:12.330 --> 05:14.080
I turned it into a snack for you.

05:14.080 --> 05:15.580
What the hell?!

05:15.580 --> 05:18.880
You're a girl, so you like sweets, right?

05:23.670 --> 05:24.960
Whoops.

05:25.290 --> 05:28.130
This guy stands more of a chance than you.

05:29.000 --> 05:30.460
Take care of Frederica-san.

05:30.460 --> 05:31.750
Uh, okay!

05:33.670 --> 05:34.500
Hup.

05:37.000 --> 05:38.750
At a time like this?!

05:37.000 --> 05:38.710
<b>One More</b>

05:37.000 --> 05:38.710
<b>[UR Guaranteed Gacha]</b>

05:37.000 --> 05:38.710
<b>Now in Progress!!</b>

05:37.000 --> 05:38.710
<b>Notice</b>

05:38.960 --> 05:41.960
No, now is the perfect time
to try my luck on this!

05:42.210 --> 05:44.960
All Apology Stones! Bring 'em home!

05:48.540 --> 05:50.420
This performance...

05:51.040 --> 05:53.000
I've got a bad feeling about this!

05:55.080 --> 05:57.380
Sorry for the wait!

05:59.630 --> 06:01.880
Hey! How is it already over?!

05:59.630 --> 06:04.040
<b>Goddess who brought Lynel</b>

05:59.630 --> 06:04.040
<b>into this world, and bestows</b>

05:59.630 --> 06:04.040
<b>the power of Apology Stones.</b>

06:01.880 --> 06:04.080
That's the look on your face right now!

06:04.330 --> 06:07.290
You just came to see
how I'm doing, right?!

06:07.290 --> 06:09.830
Nah, I'm serious this time!

06:09.830 --> 06:11.750
Oh? That means...?!

06:11.750 --> 06:13.290
Is that the spawn of the Dark God?

06:13.290 --> 06:15.630
Those things are the smallest
of the small fries, ya know!

06:15.630 --> 06:17.000
Whoa! In that case...!

06:17.210 --> 06:19.130
Well, just wait and see!

06:19.130 --> 06:22.540
I'm gonna have this
all taken care of in a sec!

06:24.420 --> 06:25.460
What's this?!

06:25.460 --> 06:28.630
I successfully summoned the Goddess!

06:32.420 --> 06:33.920
Vahanato-sama.

06:33.920 --> 06:36.790
I am surprised to see
you would come all the way here.

06:37.130 --> 06:38.750
Vanahato-sensei!

06:38.750 --> 06:40.290
Lute, it's been so long!

06:40.290 --> 06:41.540
It really has!

06:41.540 --> 06:43.790
Uh, what's going on?

06:43.790 --> 06:46.880
Well, to be honest,
meeting me was the unluckiest thing

06:46.880 --> 06:49.750
that's ever happened to you!

06:49.750 --> 06:52.830
Then, by "all taken care of" you mean...

06:52.830 --> 06:57.710
If all of humanity is wiped out,
then I "took care of things," right?

07:03.420 --> 07:05.880
Something's up with these stairs...

07:06.080 --> 07:08.960
It feels like we're going around
in an infinite loop.

07:08.960 --> 07:13.420
There may be a barrier
tampering with empty space.

07:13.630 --> 07:16.630
Maybe because there's
an important facility up ahead.

07:18.540 --> 07:21.330
I sense a slight amount
of my people's magic.

07:21.330 --> 07:26.250
Then can you do something to the barrier,
like when you helped Mokomoko-san?

07:26.250 --> 07:28.580
I don't think I should.

07:28.960 --> 07:33.330
Theodisia-san's people may be
the ones who who made this barrier.

07:40.250 --> 07:41.380
What's that?!

07:41.380 --> 07:44.130
Hm? Is the barrier gone?

07:44.130 --> 07:47.210
That saved us the trouble of doing it.
I think we can go down now.

07:49.420 --> 07:50.580
What's wrong?

07:50.580 --> 07:56.250
It's like... a monster that looked like a
blade just passed through my whole body...

07:56.250 --> 07:57.040
Huh?

07:57.500 --> 07:59.790
I feel something from over here!

08:01.330 --> 08:03.710
Is anyone there! Answer me!

08:12.460 --> 08:14.630
Dannoura-san, wait over there.

08:14.630 --> 08:15.580
Huh?

08:15.920 --> 08:17.580
It's better if you don't see this.

08:18.080 --> 08:19.460
Gotcha...

08:21.670 --> 08:24.000
Do you know if your people are here?

08:24.540 --> 08:26.960
I'm afraid this is them.

08:27.380 --> 08:29.960
Seeing my people in this condition...

08:29.960 --> 08:34.790
But my relief at the fact that my sister
isn't here seems so shallow.

08:35.330 --> 08:38.790
They were turned into these
in order to extract their magic abilities.

08:39.540 --> 08:42.250
I'll ease their suffering now.

08:47.290 --> 08:49.580
I heard what you two said.

08:49.880 --> 08:51.040
Yeah.

08:51.330 --> 08:54.290
Um, what do we do now?

08:54.290 --> 08:56.290
First we'll go back up,

08:56.290 --> 08:58.750
and what comes next
depends on what's happening.

09:00.420 --> 09:02.330
What about you, Theodisia-san?

09:03.750 --> 09:06.960
I was taught that grudges
must always be avenged.

09:06.960 --> 09:10.460
If someone is going to kill
the Swordmaster, it will be me.

09:10.880 --> 09:12.170
All right.

09:23.380 --> 09:24.580
Damn that woman!

09:24.580 --> 09:26.830
The situation looks grim.
Is she sharing her own<b>
</b>little world with my darling?!<b></b>

09:26.830 --> 09:27.290
Is she sharing her own
little world with my darling?!

09:27.290 --> 09:30.710
I'll start with qualifying you
as a Swordmaster for now.
So, Orgain, how ya been? I'm so glad...<b></b>

09:30.710 --> 09:32.880
M-me?!

09:32.880 --> 09:35.960
You're the best choice I have right now.

09:36.290 --> 09:39.960
If I die, you will automatically become
the Swordmaster.

09:40.380 --> 09:42.920
Although I have no intention of dying.

09:42.920 --> 09:44.420
What do I do?

09:44.830 --> 09:47.710
If you utilize the power
stored in the tower,

09:47.710 --> 09:49.880
you should be able to put up a fight.

09:50.250 --> 09:52.830
I'm sorry, this is my fault.

09:52.830 --> 09:55.670
I never expected
anything from you from the start.

09:57.420 --> 09:58.580
But...

09:58.580 --> 10:01.130
if I die at all, I'll just go back
to the save point!

10:01.540 --> 10:04.500
Goddess! Can I ask you something?

10:04.500 --> 10:05.960
Yes?

10:05.960 --> 10:09.630
Why are you chatting away with the enemy?

10:09.630 --> 10:11.540
Well, gosh...

10:11.540 --> 10:13.630
Should I tell you?

10:13.630 --> 10:16.080
I can't help but be curious!

10:16.080 --> 10:17.630
I bet you can't.

10:17.630 --> 10:20.790
Well, we've had a nice relationship,

10:20.790 --> 10:23.500
and I would feel bad if you died
without knowing why.

10:23.500 --> 10:25.130
I appreciate that!
and I would feel bad if you died<b>
</b>without knowing why.<b></b>

10:25.130 --> 10:26.920
Sir Lynel!

10:26.920 --> 10:28.710
He's buying us some time!

10:28.710 --> 10:32.210
My darling just suddenly
went off somewhere,

10:32.210 --> 10:34.920
and he never came back!

10:34.920 --> 10:36.630
Your "darling"?

10:36.630 --> 10:39.670
You see him, don't you?
Inside the barrier.

10:39.670 --> 10:43.330
My missing Albagarma-sama!

10:43.580 --> 10:44.500
Wha-?!

10:44.500 --> 10:46.540
I don't believe it! That name...

10:46.540 --> 10:51.000
Loathed and feared, the name of the
Dark God that no one dares to speak...

10:51.670 --> 10:55.130
So, when I sent all sorts of messengers
to search around the world,

10:55.130 --> 10:58.130
I learned that he was sealed away here!

10:58.460 --> 11:01.460
But, that's not even the worst part!

11:01.460 --> 11:05.170
No matter what I send,
I can't beat the Swordmaster!

11:05.170 --> 11:09.000
So, like, I thought if I could send
someone like you who has awful luck,

11:09.000 --> 11:12.880
maybe my darling would come back
and destroy humanity.

11:12.880 --> 11:14.330
Ack!

11:15.580 --> 11:18.630
I knew that my luck was bad,
but this is...

11:18.630 --> 11:22.540
I can't believe it's bad enough that it'll
wipe out humanity as collateral damage.

11:22.540 --> 11:23.920
Vahanato-sensei,

11:23.920 --> 11:26.080
it looks like the barrier
has mostly disappeared.

11:26.080 --> 11:27.790
Should we wait this out?

11:27.790 --> 11:30.750
I'll check, just to be sure.

11:35.710 --> 11:39.130
Until a second ago,
the creator of the barrier was here,

11:39.130 --> 11:40.670
but looks like he's dead!

11:40.670 --> 11:43.880
If he were here they could
probably fix the barrier right away!

11:46.040 --> 11:49.130
And the Goddess killer is dead too!

11:49.130 --> 11:52.920
I would've been so screwed
if he showed up!

11:52.920 --> 11:54.250
Oh, wow!

11:54.250 --> 11:58.210
People could call you
a walking apocalypse!

11:59.170 --> 12:01.000
If I'm the problem,
then I'll die to stop this!

12:01.000 --> 12:03.250
Fine by me, but you're
actually gonna die, you know?

12:03.250 --> 12:06.290
I got rid of the random walk ability.

12:06.290 --> 12:08.210
You didn't...

12:08.710 --> 12:12.540
Since you'll be dying anyways, wanna watch
my darling come back to life first?

12:14.250 --> 12:16.750
Right, now this is the barrier core.

12:16.750 --> 12:20.210
If I crush it, the barrier will be gone.

12:20.880 --> 12:23.670
It seems we've run out of options.

12:25.880 --> 12:29.040
Something tells me
things have gotten way worse!

12:29.670 --> 12:30.580
Okay!

12:30.580 --> 12:33.790
Now's the time to break
this long-standing seal!

12:33.790 --> 12:37.040
It's time to bring
my darling back to life!

12:43.580 --> 12:45.750
Ah, Darling!

12:45.750 --> 12:47.920
I've missed you!

12:59.420 --> 13:00.500
Huh?

13:10.000 --> 13:11.710
The Dark God...

13:11.710 --> 13:13.500
was dead?

13:13.500 --> 13:18.920
When we were on the roof and you said you
killed him on reflex, it freaked me out.

13:18.920 --> 13:20.460
Sorry about that.

13:23.750 --> 13:24.830
Ah!

13:24.830 --> 13:26.540
Swordmaster!

13:27.630 --> 13:29.080
Theodisia-san!

13:29.080 --> 13:31.540
I knew if there was a chance for me
to kill him, it'd be now.

13:31.540 --> 13:34.290
How could you be
thinking about that right now!

13:34.630 --> 13:37.000
D-Darling...

13:39.580 --> 13:43.540
Is that the blade monster
you saw underground?

13:43.540 --> 13:46.500
Yeah, but there are so many things
happening at once

13:46.500 --> 13:48.170
I can't tell what's what!

13:49.500 --> 13:53.130
I'm not...the one?!

13:56.920 --> 13:58.330
Sensei, hold on!

13:58.330 --> 14:00.750
I can heal this wound right away.

14:06.290 --> 14:07.460
Sensei?!

14:07.880 --> 14:10.670
Master! Albagarma-sama!

14:11.630 --> 14:13.250
Please, wake up!

14:14.080 --> 14:16.670
Master is a God
who craves living sacrifices...

14:16.670 --> 14:20.380
In that case, let us dedicate
every human to him!

14:20.380 --> 14:21.170
Yes!

14:21.170 --> 14:22.630
Sacrifices!
Present the humans!<b></b>

14:24.670 --> 14:26.540
It's already come this far, huh...

14:26.750 --> 14:28.210
Get behind me!

14:28.210 --> 14:29.500
Divine King!

14:29.500 --> 14:33.710
Kill 'em dead!
They will be sacrifices to our God!

14:34.290 --> 14:36.170
Stay near me!

14:37.710 --> 14:40.580
There are so many... This is bad.

14:40.580 --> 14:44.540
Dannoura-san, Theodisia-san,
come a bit closer to me.

14:44.540 --> 14:45.630
Huh?

14:45.790 --> 14:46.920
Like this?

14:48.880 --> 14:50.170
Die.

14:55.380 --> 14:56.330
Huh?

14:56.330 --> 14:58.170
What in the world is happening?!

14:58.330 --> 15:00.750
Hey, do we need to be so close
to you right now?!

15:00.750 --> 15:03.130
It's easier to protect you
if you're close.

15:03.540 --> 15:07.630
Lord Takatou, is it all right
to leave that woman be?

15:07.880 --> 15:10.830
She bears no hostility towards me
so I have no reason to kill her.

15:11.420 --> 15:14.460
I mean, she's acting funny, you know?

15:15.000 --> 15:16.920
Has she lost her mind?!

15:17.790 --> 15:20.920
Send me home!

15:21.250 --> 15:26.170
<b>A Sage assassin.</b>

15:21.250 --> 15:26.170
<b>Pursuing Yogiri and Tomochika.</b>

15:21.250 --> 15:26.170
<b>(Healer)</b>

15:21.250 --> 15:26.170
<b>Specializes in recovery,</b>

15:21.250 --> 15:26.170
<b>unimposing as an adventurer.</b>

15:22.040 --> 15:23.830
I told you, everything's fine.

15:23.830 --> 15:25.960
We won't die from this.

15:26.420 --> 15:30.330
Main characters have plot armor
in movie shoot-outs, right?

15:30.330 --> 15:32.170
No!

15:33.830 --> 15:37.330
Say, do you know where Yogiri Takatou is?

15:37.330 --> 15:38.500
Who are you?

15:38.920 --> 15:40.250
I'm Aoi.

15:40.250 --> 15:42.540
Are you an acquaintance of Takatou-san?

15:42.540 --> 15:44.580
This isn't the best time for that!

15:44.580 --> 15:45.830
You're right.

15:46.210 --> 15:50.290
From what I can tell,
resolving this situation takes priority.

15:50.540 --> 15:51.420
What?

15:51.420 --> 15:55.170
Are you aware that you've already
become a Swordmaster?

15:55.170 --> 15:58.040
Now that you mention it, the Swordmaster
told me something like that!

15:58.040 --> 16:01.080
If you stab her with
the Holy Sword Orz that'll end it.

16:01.630 --> 16:03.750
How did you know this is a Holy Sword?!

16:04.960 --> 16:06.710
I won't last much longer!

16:06.710 --> 16:08.210
I've got this!

16:18.380 --> 16:19.750
It's stopped.

16:20.580 --> 16:23.880
Now then, where is Yogiri Takatou?

16:23.880 --> 16:26.290
Will you look for him too, Piggy?

16:26.290 --> 16:30.500
Uh... I have a feeling he will kill me
if we meet again!

16:32.040 --> 16:34.040
That silhouette...

16:34.040 --> 16:36.130
That is, unquestionably, Tomochika-tan!

16:36.330 --> 16:37.380
You're gross.

16:37.380 --> 16:40.580
Then the man she's with is Yogiri Takatou.

16:41.630 --> 16:43.790
Hm? Could that be...

16:44.250 --> 16:46.880
I didn't see that face during the trial.

16:47.080 --> 16:50.580
Yogiri Takatou. How powerful is he?

16:54.040 --> 16:57.080
Wh-what is this?!

16:57.080 --> 16:58.830
Lady Aoi! What's the matter?!

16:58.830 --> 16:59.750
The final destination of all fates...
Lady Aoi! What's the matter?!<b></b>

16:59.750 --> 17:01.580
The final destination of all fates...

17:01.830 --> 17:04.330
Beyond that, there is nothing.

17:04.330 --> 17:08.540
All endings, in the shape of a man...

17:09.000 --> 17:14.000
Sion... Just who did you summon here?!

17:15.420 --> 17:16.460
Hanakawa-kun?

17:16.460 --> 17:17.920
What are you doing here?!

17:17.920 --> 17:21.630
I-I was brought here
against my will by Lady Aoi!

17:21.630 --> 17:23.210
Uh, Lady Aoi?

17:24.580 --> 17:25.750
Is she okay?

17:25.750 --> 17:28.080
It seems she's pretty sick...

17:28.080 --> 17:29.250
It's okay!

17:29.250 --> 17:31.250
I'll be fine after a little rest.

17:31.250 --> 17:32.380
I'm sorry!

17:32.710 --> 17:34.080
Calm down.

17:34.080 --> 17:38.460
I came to deliver this guy to you!
Since you are all schoolmates!

17:39.250 --> 17:41.420
Huh?! I don't want him though...

17:42.040 --> 17:43.080
Okay!

17:43.080 --> 17:45.330
Then I'll dispose of him right here!

17:45.330 --> 17:49.080
Stop treating me
like a worthless old book!

17:49.080 --> 17:50.880
Well, I'll be going now!

17:51.670 --> 17:53.380
Lady Aoi?!

17:55.500 --> 17:57.750
Though I'm normally not into
tomboys like her,

17:57.750 --> 18:01.250
the sight of her grovelling
has awakened a fetish within me...

18:01.250 --> 18:02.460
Ew.

18:02.460 --> 18:03.670
You know,

18:03.670 --> 18:07.580
I'm positive you went into the forest
with a collar that made you obey me.

18:07.580 --> 18:08.580
Gulp!

18:08.580 --> 18:10.540
U-uh, about that...

18:11.330 --> 18:13.500
That was a lie, wasn't it?

18:13.500 --> 18:15.130
It wasn't a lie!

18:15.130 --> 18:18.210
I just made no claim that
the effect would last forever!

18:18.210 --> 18:19.460
Please, believe me!

18:19.790 --> 18:22.040
I thought that might be what happened.

18:24.750 --> 18:27.960
So we're the only ones
left in the end, huh?

18:27.960 --> 18:29.420
Yes.

18:29.420 --> 18:33.880
There are many things I'd like to ask,
but I'd like to start with her over there.

18:34.210 --> 18:35.790
You want to know about the Swordmaster?

18:35.790 --> 18:38.250
I have only avenged
the death of my people.

18:38.250 --> 18:40.500
That has nothing to do with you.

18:40.500 --> 18:42.750
I am the Swordmaster now.

18:42.750 --> 18:44.750
I'd hardly say I'm irrelevent.

18:44.750 --> 18:48.170
If that's so, do you intend to continue
the evil deeds of your predecessor?

18:49.540 --> 18:51.750
We should all go take a look underground.

18:52.130 --> 18:56.790
If you still want vengeance,
I'll help you, Theodisia-san.

18:56.790 --> 18:58.210
Takatou-san...

18:58.210 --> 19:01.750
Not to be rude, but what can you do
with your lack of ability?

19:01.750 --> 19:03.330
Enough with your insolence!

19:03.330 --> 19:04.630
Your Highness?!

19:04.630 --> 19:06.790
You stand no chance against him.

19:06.790 --> 19:09.630
He is the one who had enough power
to vanquish the Dark God.

19:10.670 --> 19:12.830
The extermination
of the spawn of the Dark God

19:12.830 --> 19:14.880
is all due to what he has done.

19:14.880 --> 19:16.080
Am I correct?

19:16.290 --> 19:19.750
I had no intentions of interfering
with the going-ons of this world.

19:20.080 --> 19:23.040
But it just kinda happened...

19:23.710 --> 19:26.250
No, I am grateful to you.

19:26.250 --> 19:30.290
This guy killed the Dark God who had
driven the world to the brink of ruin?

19:30.630 --> 19:34.670
Takatou-san, just what are you?

19:34.670 --> 19:38.380
I'm just your average high school student
who was summoned here by a Sage.

19:38.380 --> 19:42.290
"Average high school student" is totally
robbed of meaning when applied to you!

19:42.960 --> 19:44.250
Understood.

19:44.750 --> 19:48.170
Now, what will you do next?

19:48.170 --> 19:51.000
We're heading to the royal capital,
just as planned.

19:51.000 --> 19:53.790
I'm considering heading home
to the capital as well.

19:53.790 --> 19:57.830
I think I'll go there as well,
for treatment for Frederica-san.

19:58.080 --> 20:02.130
I'll go, in order to gather intel.

20:02.540 --> 20:05.040
You were looking for your sister, right?

20:05.710 --> 20:07.830
My little sister's name is Euphemia.

20:07.830 --> 20:10.000
She's a half-demon, just as I am.

20:10.000 --> 20:11.710
Euphemia?

20:12.040 --> 20:15.170
I feel like I've heard
that name somewhere...

20:15.170 --> 20:18.580
Maybe we heard it somewhere
in the cities we passed through.

20:19.130 --> 20:21.460
Please, tell me the route you took
to get here!

20:21.460 --> 20:22.790
Sure thing.

20:22.790 --> 20:25.380
I will also return to the sanctuary
in the royal capital.

20:25.670 --> 20:30.040
Since a thousand years have passed,
my bloodline may have died out by now.

20:30.040 --> 20:32.130
Tell us the way to the royal capital.

20:32.130 --> 20:34.580
How about traveling together?

20:34.580 --> 20:35.630
No thanks.

20:35.630 --> 20:38.460
Dannoura-san and I are traveling together,
just the two of us.

20:38.460 --> 20:40.250
Uh, yeah!

20:43.540 --> 20:46.880
Okay, here's a map,
and this is for you too.

20:47.170 --> 20:48.250
A pendant?

20:48.630 --> 20:51.580
When you run into trouble in the captial,
just present this.

20:51.580 --> 20:54.330
Thanks. I'll keep that in mind.

20:54.670 --> 20:56.790
Well then, let's get going!

20:56.790 --> 20:57.830
Yeah!

20:58.330 --> 20:59.460
See you guys!

21:05.250 --> 21:07.580
We're off to the royal capital!

21:09.960 --> 21:12.210
Please wait!

21:12.210 --> 21:16.500
Don't leave me behind!

21:29.670 --> 21:33.750
They treated me like I wasn't even there!

21:33.750 --> 21:34.750
Hey.

21:35.540 --> 21:38.130
Explain to me what happened here.

21:38.380 --> 21:39.380
Huh?!

21:41.960 --> 21:45.290
Aoi-sama has gone missing
in the Garula Canyon.

21:46.040 --> 21:49.000
So, what will you do
about that Yogiri guy?

21:49.000 --> 21:55.000
<b>Sage who summoned Yogiri</b>

21:49.000 --> 21:55.000
<b>and the others to this world.</b>

21:50.920 --> 21:55.000
I just don't understand what he is.

21:55.000 --> 21:58.420
<b>Trusted assistant who</b>

21:55.000 --> 21:58.420
<b>serves Sion the Sage.</b>

21:55.250 --> 21:58.460
How about asking the
Sage candidates about him?

21:58.460 --> 22:02.580
I'd rather not interfere too much
with things other than the mission...

22:03.670 --> 22:05.710
But what do you think about this?

22:05.710 --> 22:09.880
I'm going to summon people that
Yogiri Takatou knows from Japan!

22:16.540 --> 22:19.290
Wh-what the heck is this place?!

22:19.290 --> 22:20.210
Hello!

22:20.210 --> 22:22.040
I'm Sion the Sage.

22:22.040 --> 22:24.250
I'm the one who summoned you here.

22:24.250 --> 22:26.460
A sage? Summoned?

22:26.460 --> 22:28.670
What are you talking about?

22:28.670 --> 22:32.420
I'd like to ask you about someone
named Yogiri Takatou.

22:34.330 --> 22:37.920
Summoned? Are you saying that...

22:38.210 --> 22:42.880
If parallel worlds exist,
then is that where his power came from?!

22:46.710 --> 22:49.040
There's a signal from his tracker!

22:49.040 --> 22:53.500
If you're the people who brought him here,
then you're our saviors!

22:53.500 --> 22:58.170
Let me, on behalf of mankind,
express my gratitude!

22:58.170 --> 22:59.790
What are you on about?

22:59.790 --> 23:03.500
Alpha Omega, standard opening
of gate number one confirmed.

23:03.500 --> 23:04.380
Self-destruction sequence
targeted for C-level activated.

23:03.500 --> 23:07.670
<b>C-level employee</b>

23:03.500 --> 23:07.670
<b>self-destruct sequence in progress</b>

23:04.380 --> 23:05.960
Wh-what is this?!
Self-destruction sequence<b>
</b>targeted for C-level activated.<b></b>

23:05.960 --> 23:08.000
Hey, stop this! This isn't my fault!
Self-destruction sequence<b>
</b>targeted for C-level activated.<b></b>

23:08.000 --> 23:08.960
Warning:

23:08.960 --> 23:10.170
It is recommended that all surrounding
persons move at least five meters away.

23:10.170 --> 23:11.170
Stop!
It is recommended that all surrounding<b>
</b>persons move at least five meters away.<b></b>

23:11.170 --> 23:13.170
It is recommended that all surrounding
persons move at least five meters away.

23:13.170 --> 23:15.380
No! Help me!

23:15.830 --> 23:16.330
4, 3, 2, 1...

23:16.330 --> 23:18.250
I don't wanna die!
4, 3, 2, 1...<b></b>

23:18.250 --> 23:20.130
Send me back to my wo-
4, 3, 2, 1...<b></b>

23:23.670 --> 23:26.420
Who the hell was that?

23:28.580 --> 23:30.630
Yogiri Takatou...

23:30.630 --> 23:32.960
Who in the world are you?!

23:36.710 --> 23:40.380
<b>"The Agency"</b>

23:38.040 --> 23:39.210
"The Agency"
